{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 25,
  "name": "天雷无妄",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03618",
              "text": "无妄：元亨，利贞。其匪正有眚，不利有攸往。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03618",
                "bodyParagraph": 3554
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03619",
              "text": "【白话】《无妄卦》象征不妄动妄求：极为亨通顺利，利于坚守正道。然而，如果不能坚守正道的话就会发生祸殃，因而也就不利于前去行事了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03619",
                "bodyParagraph": 3555
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03620",
              "text": "《象》曰：天下雷行，物与无妄；先王以茂对时育万物。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03620",
                "bodyParagraph": 3556
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03621",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《无妄卦》的卦象是震（雷）下乾（天）上，好比在天的下面有雷在运行之表象，象征着天用雷的威势警戒万物，并赋予万物以不妄动妄求的本性；从前的君主顺应天命，尽其所能地遵循天时以养育万物的生长。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03621",
                "bodyParagraph": 3557
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03623",
              "text": "无妄是乾上震下，天雷相动。乾象征刚健与天道，震象征雷动。行动不能离开正道；顺应事物本来的规律，则可亨通，妄求和违背原则则可能招致祸患。《序卦》说“复则不妄矣，故受之以无妄”，从回归正道发展到不妄为。无妄并非无所作为，而是在动中持正，既不要怀着侥幸贪求，也不可在条件不成熟时硬闯。古代解释常借天雷警戒万物，提示人在变动中自觉约束行为。事业宜从实际条件出发踏实前行；经商宜守商业道德、戒投机；婚姻宜诚信相待，不可强求。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03623",
                "bodyParagraph": 3559
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03626",
              "text": "初九，无妄，往吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03626",
                "bodyParagraph": 3562
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03627",
              "text": "【白话】初九，只要是不妄动妄求的话，那么，前去行事就一定会获得吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03627",
                "bodyParagraph": 3563
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03628",
              "text": "《象》曰：“无妄之往”，得志也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03628",
                "bodyParagraph": 3564
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03629",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“不妄动妄求地前去行事”，是说这样就可以实现志愿。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03629",
                "bodyParagraph": 3565
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03631",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03631",
                "bodyParagraph": 3567
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03633",
              "text": "初九爻动，变为第12卦《否卦》（天地否）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03633",
                "bodyParagraph": 3569
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03635",
              "text": "初九居震卦之始，阳爻得正，有行动之势；只要动机纯正，依照道理行事，便可“往吉”。这不是盲目冒进，而是以无妄之心主动进取。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03635",
                "bodyParagraph": 3571
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03638",
              "text": "六二，不耕获，不菑畬，则利有攸往。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03638",
                "bodyParagraph": 3574
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03639",
              "text": "【白话】六二，不在刚开始耕作时就期望立刻获得丰收，不在荒地刚开垦一年时就期望它立即变成良田，能够这样，才不是妄动妄求，因而利于前去行事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03639",
                "bodyParagraph": 3575
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03640",
              "text": "《象》曰：“不耕获”，未富也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03640",
                "bodyParagraph": 3576
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03641",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“不在刚开始耕作时就期望立刻获得丰收”，是说不企求获得非分的财富。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03641",
                "bodyParagraph": 3577
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03643",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03643",
                "bodyParagraph": 3579
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03645",
              "text": "六二爻动，变为第10卦《履卦》（天泽履）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03645",
                "bodyParagraph": 3581
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03647",
              "text": "六二强调“不耕获，不菑畲”，可理解为耕作时不把即时收获作为唯一目标，开荒时不急于要求成熟田地。做事顺其步骤，不贪非分之财，才利于前往。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03647",
                "bodyParagraph": 3583
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "六三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03650",
              "text": "六三，无妄之灾，或系之牛，行人之得，邑人之灾。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03650",
                "bodyParagraph": 3586
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03651",
              "text": "【白话】六三，无缘无故而遭受灾祸，好比有人把一头牛拴在村边道路旁，路过的人顺手把牛牵走，同村的人却被怀疑为偷牛的人而蒙受不白之冤。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03651",
                "bodyParagraph": 3587
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03652",
              "text": "《象》曰：行人得牛，邑人灾也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03652",
                "bodyParagraph": 3588
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03653",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：路过人顺手把牛牵走，意味着同村的人就会自然地被怀疑为偷牛的人而蒙受不白之冤。这种灾难不是因为自己有过，而是由于某种客观原因的巧合所造成的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03653",
                "bodyParagraph": 3589
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03655",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03655",
                "bodyParagraph": 3591
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03657",
              "text": "六三爻动，变为第13卦《同人卦》（天火同人）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03657",
                "bodyParagraph": 3593
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03659",
              "text": "六三以失牛为譬：路人偶然牵走系在村旁的牛，却可能让村里人承受怀疑或损失。无妄不意味着不会遭受外来的意外，遇到不公仍要理性应对。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03659",
                "bodyParagraph": 3595
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "九四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03662",
              "text": "九四，可贞，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03662",
                "bodyParagraph": 3598
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03663",
              "text": "【白话】九四，能够坚守正道，所以没有灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03663",
                "bodyParagraph": 3599
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03664",
              "text": "《象》曰：“可贞，无咎”，固有之也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03664",
                "bodyParagraph": 3600
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03665",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“能够坚守正道，所以没有灾祸”，是说坚守正道的品德是其本身所固有的，所以，自始至终牢固地坚守正道，才能使自己免遭灾害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03665",
                "bodyParagraph": 3601
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03667",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03667",
                "bodyParagraph": 3603
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03669",
              "text": "九四爻动，变为第42卦《益卦》（风雷益）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03669",
                "bodyParagraph": 3605
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03671",
              "text": "九四的“可贞，无咎”指坚守原则即可减少过错。外界有意外时，更要以长期一致的品行回应猜测，不必因眼前风波而失正。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03671",
                "bodyParagraph": 3607
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03674",
              "text": "九五，无妄之疾，勿药有喜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03674",
                "bodyParagraph": 3610
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03675",
              "text": "【白话】九五，不妄动妄求却身染疾病，这种疾病不需用药医治，它会不用治疗便自行消除。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03675",
                "bodyParagraph": 3611
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03676",
              "text": "《象》曰：“无妄之药”，不可试也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03676",
                "bodyParagraph": 3612
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03677",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“不妄动妄求却身染疾病，这种疾病不需用药医治”，是说药是不可以轻易尝试，随便使用的，因为病本来就可以自行消除。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03677",
                "bodyParagraph": 3613
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03679",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03679",
                "bodyParagraph": 3615
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03681",
              "text": "九五爻动，变为第21卦《噬嗑卦》（火雷噬嗑）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03681",
                "bodyParagraph": 3617
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03683",
              "text": "九五“无妄之疾，勿药有喜”在古代占辞中借突发疾病比喻不必因虚惊而随意折腾。其哲学含义是勿因无谓焦虑滥行措施，分清问题真实与否；这里不是现代医疗建议，有症状应按医学判断就诊。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03683",
                "bodyParagraph": 3619
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03686",
              "text": "上九，无妄，行有眚，无攸利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03686",
                "bodyParagraph": 3622
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03687",
              "text": "【白话】上九，虽然不妄动妄求，但是，仍然不宜于行动，如果勉强地行动，就会遭受祸殃，得不到一点好处。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03687",
                "bodyParagraph": 3623
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03688",
              "text": "《象》曰：“无妄之行”，穷之灾也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03688",
                "bodyParagraph": 3624
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-03689",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“虽然没有妄为，但如有行动（却仍然遭受祸殃）”，这是由于客观的时遇所造成的灾祸，而不以人的意志为转移。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03689",
                "bodyParagraph": 3625
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03691",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03691",
                "bodyParagraph": 3627
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03693",
              "text": "上九爻动，变为第17卦《随卦》（泽雷随）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03693",
                "bodyParagraph": 3629
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-03695",
              "text": "上九居极，时机已到尽头，即使内心不妄，贸然行动也可能遇到风险。要辨清客观环境与行动条件，避免过度执着于“立即前进”。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-03695",
                "bodyParagraph": 3631
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
